  <diagram id="NUr2CO1xv7TwguaKWWMS" name="Sequence Diagram">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1425" dy="907" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor Client as Postman / API Consumer\n    participant Controller as AccountController\n    participant UseCase as AccountUseCaseImpl\n    participant WebClient as CustomerWebClientAdapter\n    participant MSCustomer as ms-customer (:8081)\n    participant Strategy as AccountValidationStrategy\n    participant Adapter as AccountPersistenceAdapter\n    participant Mongo as MongoDB (db_pivot_account)\n\n    Client-&gt;&gt;Controller: POST /api/v1/accounts (AccountRequest JSON)\n    activate Controller\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;UseCase: execute(BankAccount domainModel)\n    activate UseCase\n\n    UseCase-&gt;&gt;WebClient: findCustomerById(customerId)\n    activate WebClient\n    WebClient-&gt;&gt;MSCustomer: GET /api/v1/customers/{customerId}\n    activate MSCustomer\n    MSCustomer--&gt;&gt;WebClient: HTTP 200 OK (CustomerSummary JSON)\n    deactivate MSCustomer\n    WebClient--&gt;&gt;UseCase: Single&lt;CustomerSummary&gt;\n    deactivate WebClient\n\n    UseCase-&gt;&gt;Adapter: findByCustomerId(customerId)\n    activate Adapter\n    Adapter-&gt;&gt;Mongo: findByCustomerId(customerId)\n    activate Mongo\n    Mongo--&gt;&gt;Adapter: Flux&lt;BankAccountDocument&gt; (Existing accounts)\n    deactivate Mongo\n    Adapter--&gt;&gt;UseCase: Flowable&lt;BankAccount&gt;\n    deactivate Adapter\n\n    UseCase-&gt;&gt;Strategy: validate(customerSummary, newAccount, existingAccounts)\n    activate Strategy\n    Strategy--&gt;&gt;UseCase: Completable (Rule evaluation result)\n    deactivate Strategy\n\n    alt Business Rule Violated (e.g., Business trying Savings or Personal &gt; 1 Savings)\n        UseCase--&gt;&gt;Controller: Single.error(BusinessRuleException)\n        Controller--&gt;&gt;Client: HTTP 400 Bad Request (ErrorResponse)\n    else Rules Passed Successfully\n        UseCase-&gt;&gt;Adapter: save(newAccount)\n        activate Adapter\n        Adapter-&gt;&gt;Mongo: save(BankAccountDocument)\n        activate Mongo\n        Mongo--&gt;&gt;Adapter: Mono&lt;BankAccountDocument&gt;\n        deactivate Mongo\n        Adapter--&gt;&gt;UseCase: Single&lt;BankAccount&gt;\n        deactivate Adapter\n        UseCase--&gt;&gt;Controller: Single&lt;BankAccount&gt;\n        deactivate UseCase\n        Controller--&gt;&gt;Client: HTTP 201 Created (AccountResponse JSON)\n        deactivate Controller\n    end&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="6iA4VZc5H6qJ-SHQwjhE-1">
